      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Organization Photo URN",
      "Anchor": "organization-photo-urn",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Organization Photo URN"
      ],
      "Text": "An organization photo URN is a composite URN that uniquely identifies a photo within a specific organization. The URN format combines:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Organization Photo URN",
      "Anchor": "organization-photo-urn",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Organization Photo URN"
      ],
      "Text": "The organization URN (e.g., urn:li:organization:1234)\nThe unique photo ID (e.g., ABC789 or a UUID like 0052aaaa-7777-8888-9362-00f4b1234aaa)",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Organization Photo URN",
      "Anchor": "organization-photo-urn",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Organization Photo URN"
      ],
      "Text": "URN Format:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Organization Photo URN",
      "Anchor": "organization-photo-urn",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Organization Photo URN"
      ],
      "Text": "urn:li:organizationPhoto:(urn:li:organization:{ORGANIZATION_ID},{PHOTO_ID})",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Organization Photo URN",
      "Anchor": "organization-photo-urn",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Organization Photo URN"
      ],
      "Text": "Examples:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Organization Photo URN",
      "Anchor": "organization-photo-urn",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Organization Photo URN"
      ],
      "Text": "Photo with ID ABC789 for organization 1234:\n Copy urn:li:organizationPhoto:(urn:li:organization:1234,ABC789)\n\n\nPhoto with UUID for organization 1234:\n Copy urn:li:organizationPhoto:(urn:li:organization:1234,0052aaaa-7777-8888-9362-00f4b1234aaa)",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "URN URL Encoding",
      "Anchor": "urn-url-encoding",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Organization Photo URN",
        "URN URL Encoding"
